# Without this, `COPY src/ src/` drops the host's bin/ and obj/ directories on top
# of the restore the image just performed — and the assets file it overwrites
# references the host's NuGet paths and SDK band. The build then fails with
# NETSDK1064 "package not found" immediately after a restore that succeeded,
# which points nowhere near the real cause.
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Not part of the image, and the context is transferred to the daemon in full.
.git/
.github/
tests/
docs/
deploy/
*.md
NOTICE
LICENSE

# Editor and OS state.
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
.DS_Store
